WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:02.977
Toad walked through the dungeon.

2
00:00:02.978 --> 00:00:06.917
His heart beat wildly.

3
00:00:06.918 --> 00:00:09.376
"This is crazy," he thought.

4
00:00:09.377 --> 00:00:13.217
"Someone will know it's me."

5
00:00:13.218 --> 00:00:16.244
Toad stepped out into a yard.

6
00:00:16.245 --> 00:00:19.033
Across the yard was a gate.

7
00:00:19.034 --> 00:00:23.883
"No one is stopping me!" thought Toad.

8
00:00:23.884 --> 00:00:27.948
"Washwoman, you're late today," said the guard.

9
00:00:27.949 --> 00:00:31.054
"Here, I'll unlock the door for you."

10
00:00:31.055 --> 00:00:34.126
"It's working!" thought Toad.

11
00:00:34.127 --> 00:00:36.662
"I fooled him!"

12
00:00:36.663 --> 00:00:40.343
Another guard stood at the next gate.

13
00:00:40.344 --> 00:00:43.539
"Give me a hug!" said the guard.

14
00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:46.020
"You work so hard.

15
00:00:46.021 --> 00:00:49.976
This prison is lucky to have you."

16
00:00:49.977 --> 00:00:53.171
Toad was giggling under his bonnet.

17
00:00:53.172 --> 00:00:55.403
He hugged the guard.

18
00:00:55.404 --> 00:00:58.696
The last gate shut behind him.

19
00:00:58.697 --> 00:01:03.422
He was free!

20
00:01:03.423 --> 00:01:06.966
People waved as Toad walked through town.

21
00:01:06.967 --> 00:01:10.232
"Hello, washwoman!" a squirrel called.

22
00:01:10.233 --> 00:01:15.569
"Hello to you!" said Toad in a high voice.

23
00:01:15.570 --> 00:01:17.935
A train whistle blew.

24
00:01:17.936 --> 00:01:20.709
"A train!" cried Toad.

25
00:01:20.710 --> 00:01:23.159
"I'll buy a ticket home!"

26
00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:25.620
Toad ran to the station.

27
00:01:25.621 --> 00:01:30.085
He hurried to the ticket window.

28
00:01:30.086 --> 00:01:34.065
"One ticket to . . ." Toad said, out of breath.

29
00:01:34.066 --> 00:01:37.483
Toad reached under his dress.

30
00:01:37.484 --> 00:01:40.337
He had no pockets.

31
00:01:40.338 --> 00:01:46.256
He had no money!

